%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: BookDataStringTable_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e1eb430fb7668243beccccafa381d9a, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 635322368
    m_Localized: "I played with my ball alone again today.\r\nWhen I kick it hard
      and it hits the wall, then bounces back\u2014that\u2019s the best part.\r\nI
      used to play with Dad, but now I have to do it by myself, so it feels a bit
      lonely.\r\nStill, I like the ball. It listens to me well.\r\nTomorrow, I\u2019m
      going to practice kicking it even farther!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673071104
    m_Localized: "I saw red blood streaming down the wall.\r\nAt first, I thought
      it was just water, but it kept getting redder\u2014thicker\u2014and it terrified
      me.\r\nIt was just a dream, but it felt so real.\r\nWhenever I see blood, I
      feel dizzy, like I can't breathe.\r\nI really, really hate blood."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 677265408
    m_Localized: "Today, I was looking at some books in Dad\u2019s study when I happened
      to glance at the clock.\r\nBut the time looked\u2026 strange.\r\nI thought
      maybe I\u2019d read it wrong, but even when I checked again, it still didn\u2019t
      seem right.\r\nI started to wonder if I\u2019d been playing too long without
      realizing it, so I left in a hurry.\r\nI told myself I shouldn\u2019t stay
      in the study for too long next time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 677265409
    m_Localized: "This morning, I looked at the clothes on the hanger, and the color
      seemed different.\r\r\nIt didn\u2019t look the same as it did yesterday, and
      I couldn\u2019t stop staring at it.\r\nMaybe I was just seeing things\u2026
      but I\u2019m not sure.\r\nThe more I think about how the clothes changed, the
      stranger\u2014and scarier\u2014it feels.\r\nWill it look normal again if I
      check tomorrow?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 681459712
    m_Localized: "Hangers scare me.\r\r\nWhen clothes are hanging on them, they look
      too much like human\u2026\r\r\nWouldn\u2019t it be better to just get rid of
      all those clothes?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 681459713
    m_Localized: "When I looked at my school uniform, the dirty footprints were still
      there.\r\nSomeone had clearly shoved and stepped on me in the hallway after
      class\u2014on purpose.\r\nAnd yet, I couldn\u2019t say a word. That\u2019s
      what made me so angry.\r\nI tried to wash the marks off with water, but they
      wouldn\u2019t come out easily.\r\nIt felt like those footprints weren\u2019t
      just on my clothes\u2026 but stamped right onto my pride."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 681459714
    m_Localized: "In my dream, the clothes hanger suddenly started moving like a
      person.\r\nIts arms stretched out and it began chasing me.\r\nI ran, trying
      to hide, but it kept reaching out, trying to grab me from behind.\r\nThe monster
      screamed that it was going to kill me, and I was so terrified I couldn\u2019t
      even scream back.\r\nWhen I woke up, I couldn\u2019t stand to look at the hanger
      anymore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 681459715
    m_Localized: "Tonight, the room went dark again, and I was so scared.\r\nWhen
      the lights go out, it feels like something is going to come and get me.\r\nHiding
      under the covers makes it a little less scary, but sometimes I still cry.\r\nIf
      Mom or Dad were here, maybe I\u2019d feel safe\u2014but they\u2019re not, so
      I have to be brave all by myself.\r\nMaybe tomorrow night, I won\u2019t turn
      the lights off when I go to sleep."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 681459716
    m_Localized: "Today, I looked at my diary and saw something that looked like
      blood on the page.\r\r\nWhen did I get hurt? When did that get there?\r\nThe
      red stain had spread across the paper, and it scared me so much.\r\nI don\u2019t
      know where it came from\u2014I just closed it and decided not to look anymore.\r\r\nI
      think I\u2019ll start writing in a new diary tomorrow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 681459717
    m_Localized: "Tonight again, the space under my bed felt so scary.\r\r\nEvery
      time I try to sleep, it feels like someone is watching me from down there.\r\r\nI
      think it\u2019s even scarier because I\u2019m sleeping alone.\r\nI kept my
      feet tucked in tightly, afraid that if they slipped out, something might grab
      me.\r\nMaybe I\u2019ll take a quick peek under the bed tomorrow during the
      day\u2026\r\r\nBut what if seeing it makes it even scarier?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 681459718
    m_Localized: "Something really scary happened tonight.\r\nA ghost\u2014or something
      like one\u2014appeared right in front of me.\r\nIt just stared at me, and I
      couldn\u2019t even breathe.\r\nWhen I pulled the blanket over my face, it disappeared\u2026\r\nbut
      I was too scared to even close my eyes, afraid it might come back.\r\nWhat
      if this keeps happening?\r\nIf Mom were here, she would\u2019ve chased all
      the scary things away\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 681459719
    m_Localized: "Today, I found a family photo.\r\r\nIt was one where Mom and Dad
      were smiling together, but the middle was torn.\r\r\nI asked Mom why she doesn\u2019t
      live with Dad anymore, and she got angry.\r\nShe said he\u2019s just busy and
      can\u2019t come\u2014but if he\u2019s busy, wouldn\u2019t he still want to
      see me?\r\r\nI tried to tape the photo back together, but the pieces didn\u2019t
      fit quite right. It looked\u2026 wrong."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685654016
    m_Localized: "I was home alone again today.\r\r\nSometimes, I wonder if my family
      has forgotten about me.\r\nOther people go places with their families\u2014so
      why am I always by myself?\r\r\nDid I do something wrong?\r\r\nWhen these thoughts
      come, my chest hurts, and the loneliness gets too heavy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685654017
    m_Localized: "Today, while I was playing with my building blocks, I saw something
      strange.\r\nOne of the blocks I had stacked suddenly had the word \u201CDead\u201D
      on it.\r\nI never made that word\u2014I don\u2019t even know how it got there.\r\nI
      was so scared that I knocked all the blocks over, but the word keeps coming
      back in my mind.\r\r\nI think I shouldn\u2019t play with them tomorrow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685654018
    m_Localized: "Today, while I was playing alone in my room, I dropped one of my
      toys.\r\nBut then\u2026 it felt like the toy was staring at me.\r\nEvery time
      I moved a little, it seemed to follow me, and that scared me so much.\r\nEven
      if I shut the door, I feel like it\u2019ll come back in my dreams.\r\nTomorrow,
      I\u2019m going to hide that toy somewhere deep, where I can\u2019t see it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685654019
    m_Localized: "In my dream today, I saw blood rising from the floor.\r\nAt first,
      it seeped in slowly, but before I knew it, the whole house was flooded in red.\r\nI
      couldn't breathe\u2014it was terrifying.\r\nI was too scared to move, afraid
      my feet might touch the blood.\r\nEven after I woke up, my heart kept pounding
      like I was still there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685654020
    m_Localized: "Today, I got my test paper back, and the moment I saw the red marks,
      my whole body froze.\r\nThey were just wrong answers\u2014but for some reason,
      the red ink looked like it was bleeding down the page. I must be an idiot.
      I couldn\u2019t even solve problems this simple\u2026 what else could I be?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685654021
    m_Localized: "I wish my father would stop drinking.\r\nWhen the alcohol takes
      over, he becomes someone else.\r\nHe throws bottles, and the shards fly everywhere.\r\nIt\u2019s
      hell.\r\nI always curl up, hoping\u2014praying\u2014it\u2019s just a nightmare."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685654022
    m_Localized: "In my dream, I walked into the classroom in the morning, and everything
      was a mess.\r\nThe desks were overturned, the chairs and books scattered everywhere\u2014it
      looked like someone had trashed the whole room on purpose. Everyone was murmuring
      in confusion, but no one knew who had done it. I felt strangely uneasy, so
      I double-checked my seat, just to be sure. Then I woke up. It felt so real\u2014like
      it had actually happened."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689848320
    m_Localized: "This morning, I looked at the clothes on the hanger, and the color
      seemed different.\r\r\nIt didn\u2019t look the same as it did yesterday, and
      I couldn\u2019t stop staring at it.\r\nMaybe I was just seeing things\u2026
      but I\u2019m not sure.\r\nThe more I think about how the clothes changed, the
      stranger\u2014and scarier\u2014it feels.\r\nWill it look normal again if I
      check tomorrow?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689848321
    m_Localized: "Hangers scare me.\r\r\nWhen clothes are hanging on them, they look
      too much like human\u2026\r\nWouldn\u2019t it be better to just get rid of
      all those clothes?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689848322
    m_Localized: "When I looked at my school uniform, the dirty footprints were still
      there.\r\nSomeone had clearly shoved and stepped on me in the hallway after
      class\u2014on purpose.\r\nAnd yet, I couldn\u2019t say a word. That\u2019s
      what made me so angry.\r\nI tried to wash the marks off with water, but they
      wouldn\u2019t come out easily.\r\nIt felt like those footprints weren\u2019t
      just on my clothes\u2026 but stamped right onto my pride."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689848323
    m_Localized: "In my dream, the clothes hanger suddenly started moving like a
      person.\r\nIts arms stretched out and it began chasing me.\r\nI ran, trying
      to hide, but it kept reaching out, trying to grab me from behind.\r\nThe monster
      screamed that it was going to kill me, and I was so terrified I couldn\u2019t
      even scream back.\r\nWhen I woke up, I couldn\u2019t stand to look at the hanger
      anymore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689848324
    m_Localized: "Today, while I was using my computer, the screen suddenly went
      strange.\r\nWeird static filled the entire display, and then nothing\u2014just
      blackness.\r\nIt felt like someone had broken it on purpose, and it sent chills
      down my spine.\r\nEven after rebooting several times, it stayed the same, so
      I just turned it off.\r\nWas it just a simple glitch\u2026 or something else?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689848325
    m_Localized: "Tonight, I was playing a game when suddenly, a ghost-like figure
      popped up on the screen.\r\r\nIt wasn\u2019t that kind of game, so I don\u2019t
      know if it was some kind of glitch, but this terrifying face just appeared
      out of nowhere. I was so startled that I dropped my mouse, and after that,
      the screen completely froze. I can\u2019t tell if it was a bug or if someone
      was messing with me, but now I\u2019m too scared to turn the game back on.
      Maybe I should take a break from gaming for a while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689848326
    m_Localized: "Today, my computer suddenly shut off.\r\nThe power was fine, but
      the screen just went completely black out of nowhere, and I panicked.\r\nI
      was in the middle of an important assignment, and I nearly lost it worrying
      that all my work was gone.\r\nI tried pressing the power button a few times,
      but there was no response, so I gave up.\r\nI have no idea why this happened,
      but if it happens again, it\u2019s going to drive me crazy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042624
    m_Localized: "Tonight, I looked out the window and saw something truly strange.
      Something ghost-like\u2014it looked like it was falling past the window. My
      heart dropped in an instant, but it happened so fast I\u2019m not even sure
      if I really saw it. Maybe it was just my imagination... but the image keeps
      replaying in my mind. I shut the window and drew the curtains, but the uneasy
      feeling still won\u2019t go away. I don\u2019t think I\u2019ll be able to sleep
      like this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042625
    m_Localized: "When I got to school today, a chrysanthemum was placed on my desk
      Why? I'm still alive\u2014so who would do something like this? I shouted, demanding
      answers from the people around me.\r\nBut no one seemed to hear my voice.\r\nHad
      I really\u2026 died?\r\nCold sweat trickled down my back. And just then, I
      woke up to the sound of my alarm. What a terrible nightmare."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042626
    m_Localized: "Today, I came home and dropped my bag\u2014and it finally burst
      open.\r\r\nMy textbooks scattered all over the floor, and seeing some torn
      pages made me sigh.\r\nI don\u2019t know why I have to carry so many books
      that my bag ends up like this.\r\nAs I picked up the mess, I told myself I
      should really organize my bag tomorrow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042627
    m_Localized: "I played a game of hangman with my friends today.\r\nBut the word
      my friend chose was impossible to guess.\r\nIn hangman, a person is tied to
      the gallows\u2014and you have to guess the word before they die.\r\nBut this
      time, the word felt like something I could never have known.\r\nI lost the
      bet, so I had to buy everyone ice cream."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042628
    m_Localized: "Today, I sat at my desk to start my homework, but the pile in front
      of me made me sigh right away.\r\nI don\u2019t even know when it got this bad,
      but now I have no idea where to begin.\r\r\nThe more I do, the more endless
      it feels\u2014like my head might explode.\r\nCan I really finish all of this
      and still make it to tomorrow?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042629
    m_Localized: "Today, I was alone in my room when the lightbulb suddenly started
      flickering. At first, I thought it was just wearing out\u2014but then the flickering
      got faster and faster, and that\u2019s when it started to feel strange. The
      light went out for a second, then came back on, and in that brief moment, the
      room felt\r\n\n*too* quiet. I kept telling myself it was just a problem with
      the bulb, but the uneasy feeling hasn\u2019t gone away. I need to replace it
      tomorrow\u2014definitely."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042630
    m_Localized: "Today, I was at the PC caf\xE9 playing games like usual, when my
      screen suddenly started acting weird.\r\nAt first, I thought it was just lag\u2014but
      then someone a few seats over said, \u201CHey, are you seeing this too?\u201D
      Everyone\u2019s game screens were either freezing or changing on their own.
      On some computers, even after the game shut down, the background music kept
      playing. The part-timer said it was probably a server issue. I was on a win
      streak, too\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042631
    m_Localized: "Today felt unusually quiet. One by one, the other customers left,
      and even the part-timer was gone for a while\u2014maybe they went to the restroom.
      I found myself alone in that wide PC caf\xE9, and somehow, it made me uneasy.
      Empty ramen cups and snack wrappers were left scattered on the desks beside
      me, and the only sound was the low hum of the ventilation. I even turned down
      the game volume, but the silence just made everything feel stranger. Maybe
      it\u2019s because when a place that\u2019s always noisy suddenly goes quiet\u2026
      it feels even louder in its stillness."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042632
    m_Localized: "At school today, a strange sound suddenly came through the speaker.
      It was a low, droning hum\u2014no words, just that sound, going on and on.
      Everyone looked around in confusion. Even the teacher didn\u2019t know what
      was happening and went to the staff room to check. A strange tension filled
      the classroom. The sound stopped after a few minutes, but the uneasiness didn\u2019t
      go away. Am I losing my mind?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042633
    m_Localized: "Today, while I was studying in my room, I noticed something strange.\r\nThe
      window\u2014which I clearly remember closing\u2014was somehow open. There\u2019s
      no way the wind could\u2019ve opened it, and the sudden realization sent chills
      down my spine. I tried to recall if I\u2019d forgotten to shut it, but I\u2019m
      certain I did. I couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that someone was watching
      me from behind, so I quickly closed the window and drew the curtains. If strange
      things like this keep happening, it\u2019s really going to get under my skin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042634
    m_Localized: "That day, I was preparing for roll call as usual when a magazine
      rolled out of a locker.\r\nIt looked real\u2014no training marks.\r\nThen a
      grenade fell out from the next one.\r\nWe called the officer immediately.\r\nThey
      covered it up quietly, but I still think...\r\r\nwhat if we hadn\u2019t opened
      them?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694042635
    m_Localized: "I sat in front of the mirror, listening to the buzz of the clippers
      as strands of hair fell around me.\r\nThe shorter my hair became, the more
      strangely hollow I felt inside.\r\nLaughter and teasing from my friends echoed
      nearby, but the face in the mirror looked unfamiliar.\r\nI ran my hand over
      my freshly cut hair\u2014and suddenly, reality hit me all at once.\r\nStarting
      today, two years\u2026\r\r\nI feel scared. Tense.\r\nI think lunch isn\u2019t
      sitting well in my stomach."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698236928
    m_Localized: 'A trumpet-like blare tore through the air, sharp enough to split
      my ears.

      It felt as if my body, deep in sleep, had been yanked violently
      to the surface.

      My mind was still clouded with confusion, yet my body
      moved on instinct alone.

      The sound had stopped, but its echo lingered
      in my head, amplifying a vague sense of unease.

      When will I finally
      grow used to this thing called society?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698236929
    m_Localized: "I saw something move in the corner of the room.\r\nAt first, I
      thought I was imagining it\u2014 but no, there it was. A bug, crawling right
      in front of me.\r\nMy body froze, and I instinctively backed away. The more
      I thought about where it might\u2019ve come from, the more my skin crawled.\r\nSuddenly,
      the whole room felt unfamiliar and uncomfortable. They say if you see one,
      the whole place is already theirs.\r\nI\u2019m so doomed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698236930
    m_Localized: "This morning, I looked at the clothes on the hanger, and the color
      seemed different.\r\nIt didn\u2019t look the same as it did yesterday, and
      I couldn\u2019t stop staring at it.\r\nMaybe I was just seeing things\u2026
      but I\u2019m not sure.\r\nThe more I think about how the clothes changed, the
      stranger\u2014and scarier\u2014it feels.\r\r\nWill it look normal again if
      I check tomorrow?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698236931
    m_Localized: "Hangers scare me.\r\r\nWhen clothes are hanging on them, they look
      too much like human\u2026\r\nWouldn\u2019t it be better to just get rid of
      all those clothes?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698236932
    m_Localized: "When I looked at my school uniform, the dirty footprints were still
      there.\r\nSomeone had clearly shoved and stepped on me in the hallway after
      class\u2014on purpose.\r\nAnd yet, I couldn\u2019t say a word. That\u2019s
      what made me so angry.\r\nI tried to wash the marks off with water, but they
      wouldn\u2019t come out easily.\r\nIt felt like those footprints weren\u2019t
      just on my clothes\u2026 but stamped right onto my pride."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 702431232
    m_Localized: "In my dream, the clothes hanger suddenly started moving like a
      person.\r\nIts arms stretched out and it began chasing me.\r\nI ran, trying
      to hide, but it kept reaching out, trying to grab me from behind.\r\nThe monster
      screamed that it was going to kill me, and I was so terrified I couldn\u2019t
      even scream back.\r\nWhen I woke up, I couldn\u2019t stand to look at the hanger
      anymore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 702431233
    m_Localized: "The computer screen suddenly turned completely blue. No text, no
      images\u2014just an empty, endless blue screen. Nothing changed, no matter
      how I moved the mouse or pressed the keys.\r\nDid I even save my work? I don\u2019t
      want to do anything anymore. A heavy, endless sense of depression is pressing
      down on me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 702431234
    m_Localized: "Today, while I was using my computer, the screen suddenly went
      strange.\r\nWeird static filled the entire display, and then nothing\u2014just
      blackness.\r\nIt felt like someone had broken it on purpose, and it sent chills
      down my spine.\r\nEven after rebooting several times, it stayed the same, so
      I just turned it off.\r\nWas it just a simple glitch\u2026 or something else?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 702431235
    m_Localized: "Tonight, I was playing a game when suddenly, a ghost-like figure
      popped up on the screen.\r\r\nIt wasn\u2019t that kind of game, so I don\u2019t
      know if it was some kind of glitch, but this terrifying face just appeared
      out of nowhere. I was so startled that I dropped my mouse, and after that,
      the screen completely froze. I can\u2019t tell if it was a bug or if someone
      was messing with me, but now I\u2019m too scared to turn the game back on.
      Maybe I should take a break from gaming for a while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 702431236
    m_Localized: "Today, my computer suddenly shut off.\r\nThe power was fine, but
      the screen just went completely black out of nowhere, and I panicked.\r\nI
      was in the middle of an important assignment, and I nearly lost it worrying
      that all my work was gone.\r\nI tried pressing the power button a few times,
      but there was no response, so I gave up.\r\nI have no idea why this happened,
      but if it happens again, it\u2019s going to drive me crazy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 702431237
    m_Localized: "I opened my phone and found my contact list completely empty.\r\nAll
      the names that once filled the screen were gone, and no matter how much I scrolled,
      there was only blank space. I knew something had to be wrong, but the weight
      of not being able to reach anyone felt strangely heavy. It made me wonder\u2014was
      I ever truly connected to anyone at all?\r\nEven after waking up and seeing
      all the names still there, the feeling of that emptiness didn\u2019t leave
      me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 702431238
    m_Localized: "In my dream, a single photograph came to mind\u2014 a warm family,
      all smiling, their shoulders gently touching in the sunlight. I think I felt
      happy, just looking at that scene. But when I woke up, I realized\u2026 that
      wasn\u2019t my family at all. In reality, I don\u2019t have any memories of
      us smiling together like that. Strangely, the dream felt so vivid that it left
      behind an aching emptiness. It was as if the dream had shown me something I\u2019ve
      never had\u2014on purpose."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 702431239
    m_Localized: "I rummaged through the sink, but all I found were empty pots and
      dishes.\r\nHoping there might be at least a pack of ramen, I opened the cupboard\u2014\r\nbut
      that hope quickly faded. There were only a few coins in my wallet, not even
      enough for a random trip to the convenience store. My stomach kept twisting,
      and the air in the room felt damp and heavy. On days like this, time seems
      to move slower, and all I can do is wait for the night to fall."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 702431240
    m_Localized: "The mountain of delivery boxes seemed endless.\r\nEvery time I
      moved one, another appeared in its place, and my arms grew heavier with each
      trip.\r\nExhaustion hit me, and I wanted nothing more than to sit on the floor\u2014but
      I couldn\u2019t stop.\r\nThe shelves were a mess, and I could hear customers
      grumbling in the distance.\r\nWhy does it always turn out like this when I\u2019m
      on shift?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 706625536
    m_Localized: "While I was working my shift, a customer was carrying a cup of
      instant noodles and must\u2019ve lost their grip.\r\nThe cup spilled onto the
      floor\u2014noodles and hot broth splashed everywhere, making a mess.\r\nThat
      was the fifth one today.\r\nWhy does this always happen to me?\r\nAnd now they\u2019re
      demanding compensation, acting like it\u2019s my fault.\r\nBut they\u2019re
      the one who dropped it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 706625537
    m_Localized: "I want to end it.\r\nThoughts like that fill my head countless
      times a day.\r\nLife is pain.\r\nYeah\u2014*Ending it today*.\r\nEnding it
      today.\r\nWhat worth does my life even have?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 706625538
    m_Localized: "As soon as I opened the door, I felt like I couldn\u2019t breathe.\r\nThe
      wardrobe and drawers were wide open, and things were scattered all over the
      floor.\r\r\nThe room felt unfamiliar\u2014cold\u2014and I thought I could smell
      something strange.\r\nIt was clear someone had broken in. My heart pounded
      with a mix of fear and anger. No matter how much I looked around, there was
      no undoing it. It all felt so empty and pointless. What was there to take,
      anyway? There\u2019s nothing here. Maybe I should just die."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 706625539
    m_Localized: "Today, while I was studying in my room, I noticed something strange.\r\nThe
      window\u2014which I clearly remember closing\u2014was somehow open. There\u2019s
      no way the wind could\u2019ve opened it, and the sudden realization sent chills
      down my spine. I tried to recall if I\u2019d forgotten to shut it, but I\u2019m
      certain I did. I couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that someone was watching
      me from behind, so I quickly closed the window and drew the curtains. If strange
      things like this keep happening, it\u2019s really going to get under my skin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 706625540
    m_Localized: "The computer screen suddenly turned completely blue. No text, no
      images\u2014just an empty, endless blue screen. Nothing changed, no matter
      how I moved the mouse or pressed the keys.\r\nDid I even save my work? I don\u2019t
      want to do anything anymore. A heavy, endless sense of depression is pressing
      down on me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 706625541
    m_Localized: "Today, while I was using my computer, the screen suddenly went
      strange.\r\nWeird static filled the entire display, and then nothing\u2014just
      blackness.\r\nIt felt like someone had broken it on purpose, and it sent chills
      down my spine.\r\nEven after rebooting several times, it stayed the same, so
      I just turned it off.\r\nWas it just a simple glitch\u2026 or something else?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 706625542
    m_Localized: "In my dream, I stopped when I saw a toy sitting off to the side.\r\nI
      was certain it didn\u2019t belong in our house, but I couldn\u2019t tell where
      it had come from.\r\nIts torn mouth, twisted into a forced smile, felt eerily
      wrong.\r\nI asked my daughter if it was hers, but she said she\u2019d never
      seen it before.\r\nLater that night, in the stillness,\r\nI couldn\u2019t shake
      the feeling\r\nthat the toy was quietly watching me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 710819840
    m_Localized: "In my dream, I stepped into the study.\r\nThe shelves, which should
      have been filled with familiar books, looked strangely unfamiliar.\r\nAs I
      moved closer, I saw that every single book was turned backward\u2014no titles,
      no covers, just blank spines lined up in a row.\r\nI reached out to pull one
      out, but no matter how hard I tried, it wouldn\u2019t budge.\r\n\nIt feels
      like\u2026 today, I\u2019m not supposed to read."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 710819841
    m_Localized: "Tonight, I was playing a game when suddenly, a ghost-like figure
      popped up on the screen.\r\nIt wasn\u2019t that kind of game, so I don\u2019t
      know if it was some kind of glitch, but this terrifying face just appeared
      out of nowhere. I was so startled that I dropped my mouse, and after that,
      the screen completely froze. I can\u2019t tell if it was a bug or if someone
      was messing with me, but now I\u2019m too scared to turn the game back on.
      Maybe I should take a break from gaming for a while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 715014144
    m_Localized: "Today, my computer suddenly shut off.\r\nThe power was fine, but
      the screen just went completely black out of nowhere, and I panicked.\r\nI
      was in the middle of an important assignment, and I nearly lost it worrying
      that all my work was gone.\r\nI tried pressing the power button a few times,
      but there was no response, so I gave up.\r\nI have no idea why this happened,
      but if it happens again, it\u2019s going to drive me crazy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 715014145
    m_Localized: "The moment I looked at the wall, my whole body froze.\r\nEyes\u2014countless
      eyes\u2014covered the surface, all staring straight at me. Different shapes
      and sizes, but every one of them fixed in the same direction.They were watching
      me. \r\nThen, as I blinked, they vanished\u2014 as if they had never existed
      at all.\r\nI must be more drained than I thought. Maybe I should go to the
      hospital when morning comes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 715014146
    m_Localized: "In the quiet of the room, my phone suddenly started buzzing, and
      then her voice came through the speaker.\r\nIt was my wife. But her voice\u2014
      it wasn\u2019t like usual. Cold. Sharp. Spitting harsh curses I\u2019d never
      heard from her before. It was unmistakably her voice, and yet\u2026 it didn\u2019t
      feel like the person I knew.\r\nLater, when I asked, she said she never called.
      What\u2026 just happened?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 715014147
    m_Localized: "Because I\u2019m away on business so often, it feels like I no
      longer have a place in my own family.\r\nMy daughter seems awkward around me,
      and even my wife seems unimpressed with a man who\u2019s always outside the
      house.\r\nI may be resting now, but it feels like I\u2019m sitting on pins
      and needles.\r\nIs this really my home?\r\nOr am I just a machine that brings
      in money?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 715014148
    m_Localized: "I want to end it.\r\nThoughts like that fill my head countless
      times a day.\r\nLife is pain.\r\nYeah\u2014*Ending it today*.\r\nEnding it
      today.\r\nWhat worth does my life even have?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 715014149
    m_Localized: "The desk I had tidied up in the morning was now a complete mess\u2014as
      if someone had deliberately thrown everything into disarray. I reached out
      to start organizing it, but didn\u2019t even know where to begin. This chaotic
      space felt like a reflection of my own mind. I told them not to come into the
      study. It was the one place where I felt at peace, and now it feels violated.
      The stress is closing in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 715014150
    m_Localized: "The desk I thought would last forever\u2014everything on it was
      gone. The pens, the stacks of papers, even the monitor\u2014vanished without
      a trace. The empty surface felt cold and unfamiliar. I reached out and ran
      my hand across it, but nothing remained. And now they\u2019re telling me to
      leave? What about my family? My daughter? I begged, on my knees, until my hands
      went numb from scraping the floor. Thank god\u2014it was just a dream. My head
      feels blank. Today\u2019s going to be a long, heavy day."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 715014151
    m_Localized: "When my daughter was little, we were always inseparable.\r\nWhenever
      I wasn\u2019t home, she would constantly ask my wife when I was coming back.\r\nAll
      I feel toward her now is guilt.\r\nDoes she still wait for me?\r\nOr has she
      grown tired of waiting?\r\nAnd if she has\u2026\r\nwhat kind of face am I supposed
      to greet her with?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 715014152
    m_Localized: "I noticed my daughter\u2019s toy tucked in the corner. It used
      to face me, but somehow, it was now turned the other way. At first, I thought
      she was just playing around and turned it back toward me\u2014\r\nbut each
      time I checked, it was always facing away again. As if it were deliberately
      avoiding me.\r\nI tried again and again to face it toward me, but somehow,
      it kept turning back. And then a thought crossed my mind\u2014 what if that
      toy is simply reflecting how my daughter feels?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 719208448
    m_Localized: "A typical family drama was playing on the living room TV.\r\nSmiling
      parents, children laughing and teasing one another\u2014but then the screen
      began to distort. Their faces twisted into something grotesque, cheerful smiles
      torn wide and wrong, with hollow black eyes staring straight at me from within
      the screen. Suddenly, something leapt out from the TV, and a chilling presence
      filled the room. I rubbed my eyes\u2014 and just like that, everything was
      normal again. \u2026Am I not meant to have a happy family?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
